          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "11. divide, separate \ndivide把一个整体分成几部分，separate把连在一起的个体分开.divide the apple, separate the houses.\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            184,
