      "markdown": "look指，从外表上看，seem指内心的判断；appear.指给人以表面的印象.\n\nappear wise, look lke his father.\n\n107. gather ,collect \n\n\n\n107. gather ,collect \n\ngather把分散的东西集中到一起，ouect指精心地、有选择地进行收集.\n\ncollect stamps.\n\n\n\n108. mean to do, mean doing \n\nmean to do 打算，想要做某事；mean doing意思是，意味着.By this I meean qiving the students more practice.Ta \n\n\n\ndie from表示死于(枪)伤，虚弱，过度劳累，饮食过度等.die of表示死于110.pay for,pay bak,pay off \n\n\n\n110.pay for,pay bak,pay off \n\npay for 为…付钱；pay back 还钱，但不一定还清；pay off还请.11. divide, separate \n\n\n\n11. divide, separate \n\ndivide把一个整体分成几部分，separate把连在一起的个体分开.divide the apple, separate the houses.\n\n\n\n112.arrive, get, reach \n\narrive 不及物动词，后接in(大地点)，at(小地点)；get不及物动词后如reaeit 113. grow,plant \n\n\n\n如reaeit 113. grow,plant \n\ngrow使某种植物在某地生长着或使其发展下去；plant移植，移栽已经\n\n长成秧苗的植物. Plant the trees， tress are growing.\n\n114. manage, try \n\n\n\n114. manage, try \n\nmanage to do设法做成了某事;try to do尽力去做某事，但不一定成功.\n\nHe tried to pass the exam,but he failed.\n\n",
